  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">URCPA AD Cashew Promotion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims at building the capacities of the leaders and the farmer members of the union in the technical management of their organization and the management of the grouped sales activity, providing them with commercialization material and storage infrastructures for their cashew nuts., Through grouped sales, agricultural revenues and social cohesion will be improved and this will help to increase the income of the farmers and create added value, wealth, etc,</narrative>
  </description>
